# Cron job authorization (Vercel Cron -> /api/cron/daily-notifications)
# Generate one:  node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# 1) Add CRON_SECRET to Vercel Project Environment Variables (Production/Preview).
# 2) In Vercel's Cron Jobs settings for this project, set the Authorization header:
#      Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET
#    (Vercel substitutes $CRON_SECRET from the project env at trigger time.)
# 3) vercel.json schedules it once daily:  "0 6 * * *"
CRON_SECRET="replace-with-a-long-random-string"

